## Commands

`package.json` is authoritative. These are the ones you will need:

```bash
{{PACKAGE_MANAGER}} install     # install dependencies
{{DEV_COMMAND}}                 # run locally
{{TEST_COMMAND}}                # full test suite
{{LINT_COMMAND}}                # lint
{{CHECK_COMMAND}}               # lint + typecheck + test — the CI gate
```

Run a single test by name rather than the whole suite while iterating.

